745
00:46:52,560 --> 00:46:53,853
Trinta.

746
00:46:57,898 --> 00:46:59,066
Trinta e cinco.

747
00:47:00,484 --> 00:47:03,195
Meu TOC tem a ver com

748
00:47:03,279 --> 00:47:07,158
